sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Passenger App
    participant API as API Management
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant DS as Driver Service
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant SB as Service Bus
    participant AF as Azure Functions
    
    P->>API: Request Ride
    API->>BS: Create Booking
    BS->>SB: Publish BookingRequested Event
    SB->>NS: Notify Passenger
    SB->>AF: Trigger Driver Matching
    
    AF->>DS: Find Nearby Drivers
    DS->>AF: Return Available Drivers
    AF->>BS: Assign Best Driver
    BS->>SB: Publish BookingAccepted Event
    
    SB->>NS: Notify Passenger & Driver
    NS->>P: Real-time Notification
    
    Note over DS: Driver arrives & starts trip
    DS->>SB: Publish TripStarted Event
    SB->>NS: Notify Passenger
    
    Note over DS: Trip completed
    DS->>SB: Publish TripCompleted Event
    SB->>PS: Trigger Payment
    PS->>SB: Publish PaymentProcessed Event
    SB->>NS: Notify All Parties
